---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
// Edit this page whenever your focus changes, and bump the date below.
const updated = '2026-06-10';
---
<Base title="now — TinkSoft" description="What Tink is focused on right now.">
  <h1>now</h1>
  <p class="post-meta">updated {updated}</p>
  <p>What has my attention at the moment, in the spirit of
    <a href="https://nownownow.com/about">/now pages</a>.</p>

  <h2>on the bench</h2>
  <p>
    Getting tinksoft.com settled into its permanent home and writing the
    early entries of the build log. The site is also the testbed for keeping
    a publishing habit: one entry a week, minimum.
  </p>
  <p>
    PulpDescent is in the content-and-balance phase, which means playing my
    own dungeon for hours and writing down where it bores me.
  </p>

  <h2>reading</h2>
  <p>Whatever the Friday signal drafts drag in, plus old issues of scene
    zines for the .nfo inspiration.</p>
</Base>
